cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "CR-TOMO: Cosmic-Ray Anisotropy, Geomagnetic Backtracing and Heliospheric Tomography"

message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Johnson
    given-names: Rindhuja Treesa

version: 0.1.0

date-released: 2026-09-28

abstract: >
  CR-TOMO is an open-source research framework for investigating
  cosmic-ray variability and anisotropy using neutron-monitor
  observations, with planned extensions toward geomagnetic
  particle backtracing and heliospheric tomography.

